09.240">I'd </span><span begin="00:09.240" end="00:09.540">rather </span><span begin="00:09.540" end="00:09.900">feel </span><span begin="00:09.900" end="00:10.350">pain </span><span begin="00:10.350" end="00:10.650">than </span><span begin="00:10.650" end="00:11.160">nothing </span><span begin="00:11.160" end="00:11.340">at </span><span begin="00:11.340" end="00:14.880">all</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.940" end="00:30.060"><span begin="00:26.940" end="00:27.390">You're </span><span begin="00:27.390" end="00:28.230">sick </span><span begin="00:28.230" end="00:28.530">of </span><span begin="00:28.530" end="00:29.220">feeling </span><span begin="00:29.220" end="00:30.060">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.060" end="00:33.120"><span begin="00:30.060" end="00:30.420">You're </span><span begin="00:30.420" end="00:31.200">not </span><span begin="00:31.200" end="00:31.680">the </span><span begin="00:31.680" end="00:32.310">only </span><span begin="00:32.310" end="00:33.120">one</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.120" end="00:35.790"><span begin="00:33.120" end="00:33.390">I'll </span><span begin="00:33.390" end="00:34.140">take </span><span begin="00:34.140" end="00:34.560">you </span><span begin="00:34.560" end="00:34.950">by </span><span begin="00:34.950" end="00:35.160">the </span><span begin="00:35.160" end="00:35.790">hand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.790" end="00:39.090"><span begin="00:35.790" end="00:35.970">And </span><span begin="00:35.970" end="00:36.090">I'll </span><span begin="00:36.090" end="00:36.300">show </span><span begin="00:36.300" end="00:36.540">you </span><span begin="00:36.540" end="00:36.630">a </span><span begin="00:36.630" end="00:37.110">world </span><span begin="00:37.110" end="00:37.260">that </span><span begin="00:37.260" end="00:37.380">you </span><span begin="00:37.380" end="00:37.680">can </span><span begin="00:37.680" end="00:39.090">understand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.090" end="0